Zzz... Zzz...{VAR BE01}
...W-what?
What do you want, now?{VAR BE01}
Did you pick now to listen to
my stories?

Mmm... OK, I'll tell you...{VAR BE01}
Behind our Lacunosa Town,
there's a big hole in the ground.{VAR BE01}
That hole, way in the past...{VAR BE01}
Aaaahhh, I'm so tired...{VAR BE01}
That hole, there was a...a big...
crashed down...inside was...{VAR BE01}
big, scary...really scary...{VAR BE01}
Zzz... Zzz... Zzz...

My grandma loves old stories!{VAR BE01}
I'm always having to listen
to her really long stories.{VAR BE01}
But sometimes if it's night, she'll
fall asleep right in the middle of a story.{VAR BE01}
It's OK, though. She's not only healthy,
she's a free-spirited grandma, too!
